{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"巴基斯坦","country_iso":"PAK","created_at":"2026-04-10T09:16:02.383731","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"PAK-HB-0007","ldc":"No","location":"开伯尔普什图省","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"巴基斯坦开伯尔普什图省石油炼化项目","project_name_en":"Pakistan Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Oil Refinery Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"","content":"近日，中国能源建设集团广东省电力设计研究院有限公司、中国葛洲坝集团国际工程有限公司与业主FALCONOILS(PVT)LTD(FALCON石油公司)签署了巴基斯坦开伯尔普什图省石油炼化项目EPC合同协议。\n联合体中，葛洲坝国际公司占比40%，广东院占比60%。合同金额35.88亿美元，折合人民币约241.39亿元。\n项目工程内容为建设一座日产量10万标准桶的石油炼化厂及其附属输油管道、储油罐等设施。主要工作范围包括：日处理10万桶/日或500万吨/年的炼油厂;100MW自备电站，277km的石油管道及440万立方的储存油库等。","content_sha256":"ee0814b9b048d7828b9f82d38557133714a040f965c740d871174f3bdb84b1cd","id":23830,"publish_date":"2019-05-11 18:30:17","title":"中企获巴基斯坦炼化EPC合同","title_sha256":"2381ee16939fa9e9cae01787b77ddb8e20c63553f5271d19605a34c4ba29c86f","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/9155.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"PAK-HB-0007","capacity_details":"日产量10万桶的石油炼化厂，100MW自备电站","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T09:16:02.385147","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"PAK-HB-0007-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://hk.finance.yahoo.com/news/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E8%83%BD%E6%BA%90%E5%BB%BA%E8%A8%AD-03996-hk-%E9%99%84%E5%B1%AC%E8%A8%82%E5%B7%B4%E5%92%8C%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%9F%B3%E6%B2%B9%E7%85%89%E5%8C%96%E9%A0%85%E7%9B%AEepc%E5%90%88%E5%90%8C-083700480.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"FA